WEBVTT

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.996
It represents an amount
of digital information

00:00:32.037 --> 00:00:36.454
that is uncomfortable to store,
transport, or analyse.

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:38.579
Big Data is so voluminous

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:40.871
that it overwhelms 
the technologies of the day

00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:42.204
and challenges us to create

00:00:42.246 --> 00:00:46.162
the next generation
of data storage tools and techniques.

00:00:50.954 --> 00:00:52.996
So, big data isn’t new.

00:00:53.037 --> 00:00:55.329
In fact, physicists at CERN 
have been wrangling

00:00:55.371 --> 00:01:00.662
with the challenge of their 
ever-expanding big data for decades.